    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled Active Viscous Epiblast Stokes Flow, Strain-Rate Myosin Cable Alignment & Lagrangian Primitive Streak Attractor (Saadaoui-Serra-Mahadevan-Weijer Active Nematic Mechanics)" ;
